        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International AP-PH-6615, 12\" Palermo Appliance Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe swirl design of the 12\" Palermo Refrigerator Pull will add a bit of whimsy to any appliance door. RK International's Palermo Collection is ornate without seeming dated. Available in 6 finishes including brushed english (pictured) and weathered nickel. It comes packaged with all the necessary installation hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe AP-PH-6615 Palermo Collection Appliance Pull is not just for refrigerators. Add a cohesive and look throughout your kitchen by adding them to every appliance in your home.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/fancy-palermo-cabinet-door-pull-rk-international\"><b>Matching Palermo Cabinet Pull</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/palermo-cabinet-cup-pull-rk-international-cf-915\"><b>Matching Palermo Cabinet Cup Pull</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/swirl-design-palermo-cabinet-knob-rk-international-ck-115\"><b>Matching Palermo Round Cabinet Knob</b></a>, and\r\n<a href=\"/products/rectangle-palermo-collection-cabinet-knob-rk-international-ck-116\"><b>Matching Palermo Rectangular Cabinet Knob</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Palermo Collection Appliance Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Zinc</li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 12-13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-5/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting screws for a refrigerator/appliance door panel.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
